      "side": 1,
      "message": "FYI, I recalled why we query default backend format for color type from skia. It is because, skia can have many backends (GL, Vulkan, DX, Dawn). and skia may make some different decision based on gpu caps, format properties (some default formats are not renderable, skia may choose other format to simulate them?). So we would like to always depend on skia to make the decision, chrome code will follow it.",
